  m_text: "Six pieces scattered, six pieces lost,\nEach one taken, each one the cost.\nBring
    them back to where it began,\nAnd watch as it rises \u2014 no longer a man.\nThe
    lights will flicker, the silence will break,\nWhen the body is whole... it starts
    to wake."
